                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "be839740-1883-3ad3-80f6-2d4df4630ebb",
                        "entry_id": "22948146-132f-3854-85d8-1f4f32a07405",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A stringed instrument without frets on the fingerboard."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "042d0763-380c-4dbc-9928-c3b0421ac0f1",
                                "sense_id": "be839740-1883-3ad3-80f6-2d4df4630ebb",
                                "text": "Read's creations have covered just about all of bass-dom, from vintage-style 4-strings to 32-position fretlesses to 25-fret 8-strings tuned F♯BEADGCF."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d06f3d7b-2092-4cc2-8063-0249ccc53e32",
                                "sense_id": "be839740-1883-3ad3-80f6-2d4df4630ebb",
                                "text": "No other machine can produce sounds which are so often described as 'singing', 'purring', 'humming', and 'ringing'. But this array of mellifluous notes doesn't come cheaply: even those who have mastered the fretless to moderate levels of proficiency have been obliged to spend many hundreds of hours on techniques which fretted-bass players either take for granted or simply do not require."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1efda118-4454-4776-ba2c-54656bd7560c",
                                "sense_id": "be839740-1883-3ad3-80f6-2d4df4630ebb",
                                "text": "Many fretlesses, especially less expensive models that mimic a fretted counterpart, have fretted-bass nut slots."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
